        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Ground: faded bluish grey warp twill, (alternate warps paired) tied by greyish blue weft.  Design: symmetrical trees to which pairs of animals are chained; cartouches with simulated Arabic letters, and pairs of birds, woven with tarnished gold weft (gilded skin wound on line), tied with a fine neutral silk weft. Worn."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/42bbc65c-8782-3321-9891-6c724d9a9dc2> ;
